      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">This tab captures Bacteriology test results for the patient, which differ from laboratory tests. Bacteriology test results include smear test results, culture test results and drug-sensitivity test results.</span></p><p>                                  <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%201.33.14%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448352261675&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=458\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%201.33.14%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448352261675&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013411\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-11-24 at 1.33.14 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013226\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"39\" data-media-id=\"3a4cb33e-1989-4784-a0e5-8fd0fdc865a4\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%201.33.14%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448352261675&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1259&amp;height=824 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%201.33.14%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448352261675&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=458 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Bacteriology Tab</strong></p><h2 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><h3 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-Configurethetab(Bacteriology)\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Configure the tab (Bacteriology)</span></h3><p><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Below is the sample code snippet to configure the tab under clinical consultation. Add the configuration under <em>clinical/extension.json.</em></span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3c4e0f46-57b7-422f-8a43-19154bb491d0\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\"> &quot;bahmniClinicalConsultationBacteriology&quot;: {\n  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical.consultation.bacteriology&quot;,\n  &quot;extensionPointId&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board&quot;,\n  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;link&quot;,\n  &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Bacteriology&quot;,\n  &quot;translationKey&quot;:&quot;BACTERIOLOGY_BOARD_LABEL_KEY&quot;,\n  &quot;url&quot;: &quot;bacteriology&quot;,\n  &quot;icon&quot;: &quot;icon-user-md&quot;,\n  &quot;order&quot;: 7\n}</pre>\n</div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"dc6c961e-0844-410e-a0a3-9453fb5409e6\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Please refer to the following link to know more about this configuration: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/extension.json\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/extension.json</a></p></div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e8d9c666-b41e-4fb4-ad27-72342a799c83\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Please make sure to configure the value of <em><strong>url</strong></em><strong> </strong>to be &quot;<em><strong>bacteriology</strong></em>&quot; and <em><strong>extensionPointId</strong></em> to be &quot;<em><strong>o</strong><strong>rg.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board </strong></em>&quot;<em><strong>.</strong></em></p></div></div><p><br/></p><h3 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-DefinetheCoreFieldsandResultCapturingForms\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Define the Core Fields and Result Capturing Forms</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Configure </span>Bacteriology <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/50921567/Configure+Concept+or+Concept+Set\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50921567\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Concept Set</a> in <strong>OpenMRS</strong> by performing the following steps:</p><h4 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-Addcorefields\">Add core fields</h4><p>These are the fields that help the page to be populated. All these fields be set members of concept set &quot;BACTERIOLOGY CONCEPT SET&quot;.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"63c22210-5d8b-4209-b9c7-d9adc55e744e\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>For Example, in the below screenshot, <em>Specimen Collection Date</em>,<em>Specimen Sample Source </em>and <em>Specimen ID </em>are the fields (concepts) added as members of concept set (&quot;BACTERIOLOGY CONCEPT SET).</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"bbd61186-206a-4236-8f5c-9e944285a212\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Use Openmrs UI to edit the concept</p></div></div></div></div><p><br/><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%202.04.19%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448354127186&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=554&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%202.04.19%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448354127186&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013418\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-11-24 at 2.04.19 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013226\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"39\" data-media-id=\"e6fc302f-ec9f-4024-b8d3-430c8ff6355f\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%202.04.19%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448354127186&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1108&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%202.04.19%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448354127186&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=554&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><h4 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-AddtheBacteriologyResultsforms\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Add the Bacteriology Results forms</span></h4><p>These forms are for capturing the test results for bacteriology.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e3a158ea-a71a-446e-a8ac-12b1bc4688fd\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>To add a form, please follow the steps mentioned in <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014552/Create+a+New+Observation+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014552\" data-linked-resource-version=\"110\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">create a new observation form</a><span>.</span></p></div></div><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"> Sample CSVs (concepts and concept_sets) are given below.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4a618ee2-0654-4fea-a811-2908b3631a86\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>If any concept which is given in the below sample CSVs already exists, it will be updated with the given parameters for that concept in the CSV.</p></div></div><p><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"> <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"9d923c29-2b7f-44e6-b0e5-808a99ff4703\" data-macro-name=\"view-file\"><a class=\"confluence-embedded-file\" href=\"/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/bacteriology_concepts_new.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1525354039636&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-nice-type=\"null\" data-file-src=\"/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/bacteriology_concepts_new.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1525354039636&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-linked-resource-id=\"637992964\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013226\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"bacteriology_concepts_new.csv\" data-mime-type=\"text/csv\" data-has-thumbnail=\"true\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-media-id=\"7e6f4799-7a5c-4931-98de-b0e2209d2c81\" data-media-type=\"file\"><img src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/bacteriology_concepts_new.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1525354039636&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;viewType=fileMacro\" height=\"250\" /></a></span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"3be81800-0106-4725-827d-ecef2d6f9a93\" data-macro-name=\"view-file\"><a class=\"confluence-embedded-file\" href=\"/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/bacteriology_concept_sets.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1461577227309&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-nice-type=\"null\" data-file-src=\"/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/bacteriology_concept_sets.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1461577227309&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-linked-resource-id=\"55214242\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013226\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"bacteriology_concept_sets.csv\" data-mime-type=\"text/csv\" data-has-thumbnail=\"true\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-media-id=\"14e959f4-d717-45cf-99ca-4009d2d392c9\" data-media-type=\"file\"><img src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/bacteriology_concept_sets.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1461577227309&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;viewType=fileMacro\" height=\"250\" /></a></span><br/></span></p><h4 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-AddAdditionalfields\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Add Additional fields</span></h4><p><span>In order to configure additional fields in this Bacteriology page, a</span>dd those fields as members to <strong>Bacteriology Additional Attributes</strong> Concept Set </p><p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"85be5afb-af79-4608-bd75-9498931baa15\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Use Openmrs UI, to add these fields (concepts)</p></div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f43cc28d-6fcb-45a9-ac35-b780b975b988\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><p class=\"title\">Example</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>In below screenshot, Laboratory Name is one of the Additional Field added</p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202016-01-14%20at%2012.26.51%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1452754644329&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=665&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202016-01-14%20at%2012.26.51%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1452754644329&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37355603\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-01-14 at 12.26.51 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013226\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"39\" data-media-id=\"4cd4a137-4a55-483f-af5d-346f8e869f69\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202016-01-14%20at%2012.26.51%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1452754644329&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1330&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202016-01-14%20at%2012.26.51%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1452754644329&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=665&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-DisplayBacteriologyResults\">Display Bacteriology Results </h3><p><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">One can choose to view the Bacteriology results on a Dashboard Page in two ways :-</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Obs to Obs Flow Sheet </span></li><li>Bacteriology results Display control</li></ul><h4 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-ObstoObsFlowSheet\">Obs to Obs Flow Sheet</h4><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"afb1bfc9-3dd8-4da5-9cce-55867b358cce\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>More about the control <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945573/Display+Controls#DisplayControls-ObsToObsFlowSheet\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945573\" data-linked-resource-version=\"155\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Display Controls#ObsToObsFlowSheet</a></p></div></div><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">For example, add the configuration below in <em>clinical/dashboard.json</em></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"48eaa6f2-300e-4e3d-a90a-4341eb953534\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;Bacteriology Concept Set&quot;: {\n    &quot;displayType&quot;: &quot;Full-Page&quot;,\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_BACTERIOLOGY_RESULTS_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;obsToObsFlowSheet&quot;,\n    &quot;dashboardConfig&quot;: {\n        &quot;numberOfVisits&quot;: 1,\n        &quot;initialCount&quot;: 3,\n        &quot;latestCount&quot;: 4,\n        &quot;templateName&quot;: &quot;BACTERIOLOGY CONCEPT SET&quot;,\n        &quot;groupByConcept&quot;: &quot;Specimen Collection Date&quot;,\n        &quot;conceptNames&quot;: [\n            &quot;Specimen Id&quot;\n        ]\n    },\n    &quot;expandedViewConfig&quot;: {\n        &quot;templateName&quot;: &quot;BACTERIOLOGY CONCEPT SET&quot;,\n        &quot;groupByConcept&quot;: &quot;Specimen Collection Date&quot;\n    }\n}</pre>\n</div></div><p>The Bacteriology results will be visible on the Patient Dashboard as shown in the screenshot below:</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%203.56.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448360814634&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=364\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%203.56.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448360814634&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013460\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-11-24 at 3.56.20 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013226\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"39\" data-media-id=\"43850676-1b92-46de-b5df-4ff1b91f3034\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%203.56.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448360814634&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1226&amp;height=639 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-24%20at%203.56.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448360814634&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=364 1x\"></span></p><h4 id=\"ConfigureBacteriologyTab-BacteriologyResultsDisplayControl\">Bacteriology Results Display Control</h4><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ad20ac34-7b2a-4772-8497-f498b22ada8c\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>More about this control <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945573/Display+Controls#DisplayControls-BacteriologyResultsControl\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945573\" data-linked-resource-version=\"155\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Display Controls#BacteriologyResultsControl</a></p></div></div><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">For example, add the configuration below in <em>clinical/dashboard.json</em></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0b429f70-ce69-47c6-838b-3e6971cf6db7\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;bacteriologyResults&quot;: {\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_BACTERIOLOGY_RESULTS_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;bacteriologyResultsControl&quot;,\n    &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;All&quot;,\n    &quot;orderType&quot;: &quot;&quot;,\n    &quot;dashboardConfig&quot;: {\n        &quot;conceptNames&quot;: [\n            &quot;BACTERIOLOGY CONCEPT SET&quot;\n        ]\n    }\n}</pre>\n</div></div><p>The Bacteriology results will be visible on the Patient Dashboard as shown in the screenshot below:</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-07%20at%202.35.39%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460019975264&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=463\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-07%20at%202.35.39%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460019975264&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50921639\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-07 at 2.35.39 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013226\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"39\" data-media-id=\"a7486ecc-3faf-4875-a4a7-49611ddd153d\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-07%20at%202.35.39%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460019975264&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1328&amp;height=880 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013226/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-07%20at%202.35.39%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460019975264&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=463 1x\"></span></p><p>                  </p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"8900e04d-38e4-406d-9feb-b2ef0df10479\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/40501380/Capturing+Bacteriology+Test+Results\" data-linked-resource-id=\"40501380\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bacteriology Tab - Feature Guide</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
